  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 22 - reached heaven
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: ' So you have finally reached Heaven, my friend'
    portugueseLine: "Ent\xE3o voc\xEA finalmente chegou ao c\xE9u, meu querido."
    chineseLine: "\u6240\u4EE5\u4F60\u7EC8\u4E8E\u5230\u4E86\u5929\u5802\u3002"
    spanishLine: ' Entonces finalmente llegaste al cielo.'
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' I thought it would be prettier...  It looks more like a tacky
      version of a battlefield.'
    portugueseLine: "Eu achava que ia ser mais bonito... Parece mais com uma vers\xE3o
      brega de um campo de batalha."
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u539F\u4EE5\u4E3A\u4F1A\u66F4\u7F8E... \u7ED3\u679C\u66F4\u50CF\u6218\u573A\u7684\u5EC9\u4EF7\u7248\u672C\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Pens\xE9 que ser\xEDa m\xE1s bonito...  Parece m\xE1s como una
      versi\xF3n kitsch de un campo de batalla."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Heaven is a reflection of war. Don\u2019t be naive."
    portugueseLine: "O c\xE9u \xE9 um reflexo da guerra. N\xE3o seja ing\xEAnuo."
    chineseLine: "\u5929\u5802\u662F\u6218\u4E89\u7684\u53CD\u6620\u3002\u522B\u5929\u771F\u3002"
    spanishLine: ' El cielo es un reflejo de la guerra. No seas ingenuo.'
